## When to come back

This document is alive. Re-read when:

- The upstream <system-name> releases a major version.
- The downstream team introduces a new Tier 1 component.
- You discover an invariant violation (see `risk-raw.md`).
- You onboard a new teammate to this slice of <system-name>.
